n&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWalkers and cyclists can enjoy a wide variety of footpaths and trails. This house is a superb base for discovering the stunning countryside that is all around or for experiencing the medieval market town of Saffron Walden. You&amp;rsquo;ll find many fantastic pubs and restaurants here.&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\nTake the kids to Audley End Miniature Railway where they can ride mini steam engines. Alternatively, take a look around the breath-taking Audley End House or spend a day at Saffron Walden Golf Club. Cambridge is only a short drive away where you can go punting on the river or enjoy a night out.&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWhatever you choose to do with your time, you will have a fantastic stay at Abbey House.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;,
