            {
                &quot;id&quot;: 3,
                &quot;property_id&quot;: 575791,
                &quot;customer_property_id&quot;: &quot;MH&quot;,
                &quot;active&quot;: 1,
                &quot;property_name&quot;: &quot;Milton House by Group Retreats&quot;,
                &quot;subcaption&quot;: &quot;Sleeps 30 - Grand Country House, Indoor Pool &amp; Spa&quot;,
                &quot;description&quot;: &quot;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;span style=\&quot;font-size:12px\&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=\&quot;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\&quot;&gt;Welcome to Milton House! This grand country residence is set amongst beautiful private grounds, wonderfully secluded and is within easy reach of Bedford. Explore the gardens, relax by the fire or enjoy some time in the pool, with space enough for everyone. Milton House is the perfect spot for a family holiday, celebration or work away day.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;,
                &quot;accommodations_summary&quot;: &quot;Approaching Milton House along the private driveway, from the moment you arrive you will feel right at home. The impressive dining room seats 22, and up to 30 with an additional table, so everyone can dine together in style. The kitchen is fully stocked with everything you will need to prepare and enjoy a fantastic meal, whether you decide to cook it yourself or bring in a professional chef.&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThe large drawing room provides enough space for everyone and is the perfect spot to get together and enjoy a drink in the company of good friends. The patio doors open to reveal impressive views of the gardens and grounds. The conservatory also has doors out onto the patio and is a great place to sit and enjoy the gardens. Leading on from the conservatory, you will find a fantastic heated indoor pool and hot tub. There is also a cosy snug, furnished with a TV and comfy seating for when you want to put your feet up and enjoy some downtime.&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMilton House has a total of 10 fantastic bedrooms, six bathrooms and a downstairs loo. All bedding, linen and towels are provided. Our games room has a snooker table, table tennis, darts board and movie area. Outside, we have wonderful gardens to explore, complete with a barbecue area, tennis court and interconnected lakes which attract all kinds of wildlife. Being close to the the Twinwoods Adventure Park which offers indoor skydiving and surfing, as well as Bedford town centre, there is plenty to do in the local area! Bedford has a wonderful river to walk along as well as many great pubs, restaurants and shops. Bedford train station is on a direct line to London Bridge and Kings Cross St Pancras. With great links to the M1 and A1 and plenty of parking; getting to Milton House is a breeze.&lt;br /&gt;\r\n &quot;,
                &quot;location_description&quot;: &quot;Milton Ernest is a lovely village about miles away...&quot;,
                &quot;changeover&quot;: &quot;&quot;,
