                &quot;id&quot;: 5,
                &quot;property_id&quot;: 575794,
                &quot;customer_property_id&quot;: &quot;FC&quot;,
                &quot;active&quot;: 1,
                &quot;property_name&quot;: &quot;Fawley Court by Group Retreats&quot;,
                &quot;subcaption&quot;: &quot;Sleeps 36+ Grand Manor House, Indoor Pool and Spa&quot;,
                &quot;description&quot;: &quot;&lt;span style=\&quot;font-size:12px\&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=\&quot;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\&quot;&gt;Fawley Court is a stunning country manor house set in the beautiful Wye Valley. With an impressive dining room, indoor pool and hot tub, 13 bedrooms it is the perfect place to get everyone together!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;,
                &quot;accommodations_summary&quot;: &quot;&lt;span style=\&quot;font-size:12px\&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=\&quot;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\&quot;&gt;Welcome to Fawley Court! Set amongst beautiful gardens in the heart of the Wye Valley, your group will be stunned from the moment they arrive at Fawley Court. Whether you choose to spend time with the family, relaxing by the fire or celebrate in style and enjoy some drinks by the pool, your time at Fawley Court will become treasured memories!&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\nInside the house, you will find our &amp;#39;Great Hall&amp;#39;, with a huge fire place and seating for up to 36, you can really dine in style! The kitchen is fully stocked with everything you will need to prepare and enjoy a fantastic meal, whether you decide to cook it yourself or bring in a professional chef.&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\nLeading off from the Great Hall there are a further three reception rooms. The Drawing Room is perfect for entertaining, the snug has comfy seating and a TV and the lounge has a card table and chess board.&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\nAt the other end of the house our fantastic indoor pool can be found. Our hot tub can seat up to eight! Leading off from the pool we have a games room with a large TV, pool table, dart boards, table football and plenty of seating. The conservatory and walled garden have seating for the whole group and BBQ.&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\nFawley Court has a total of 13 fantastic bedrooms, 4 of which are ensuite, a further 6 bathrooms and a downstairs loo. All bedding, linen and towels are provided.&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\nOutside we have wonderful gardens to explore with interconnected lakes which attract all kinds of wildlife.&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\nBeing in the heart of the Wye Valley, there is amazing countryside to be explored and amazing views to be seen!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;,
                &quot;location_description&quot;: &quot;Set amongst beautiful gardens in the heart of the...&quot;,
