            {
                &quot;id&quot;: 7,
                &quot;property_id&quot;: 585934,
                &quot;customer_property_id&quot;: &quot;CE&quot;,
                &quot;active&quot;: 1,
                &quot;property_name&quot;: &quot;The Castle by Group Retreats&quot;,
                &quot;subcaption&quot;: &quot;&quot;,
                &quot;description&quot;: &quot;The Castle is set in over seventeen acres of gardens, woodland and open land. Laden with decadent features, from the sweeping main staircase, a dungeon spanning the palatial base of the castle, with 11 beautifully decorated bedrooms.&lt;br /&gt;\r\nLarge enough to be stately, small enough to be intimate, and one of England&amp;rsquo;s most exceptional properties.&quot;,
                &quot;accommodations_summary&quot;: &quot;&lt;p&gt;A warm welcome to The Castle, a truly exceptional Grade II* castle which is steeped in history since the early 1700&amp;#39;s. Nestled away in the Durham countryside, sitting in 14 acres of land surrounded by a nature reserve. This is the ideal place to escape from the modern world and indulge with friends and family. Whether that be sitting by one of the many fireplaces with a good page turner or retreating to the dungeon for a drink in it&amp;#39;s own self service bar.&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThe dungeon is fashioned with wrought iron gates, which hosts multiple rooms spanning the entire footprint of the Castle.&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThe truly exceptional main entrance hall greets you with an elegant sweeping staircase. A real showstopper for entertaining, creating a feel for the rest of the property. The formal dining room equally offers a wonderful setting for self catered dining and seats up to 32 guests.&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThe ground floor houses the living quarters which comprises of the Entrance Hall, Dining room, Living room, Lounge, and Kitchen.&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThe sleeping quarters include 11 beautifully decorated bedrooms over two floors and 12 bathrooms. Plenty of room for large groups. &lt;span style=\&quot;font-size:12px\&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=\&quot;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\&quot;&gt;All bedding, linen and towels are provided.&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThe garden can be accessed through open doors onto a sun trapped patio, which has plenty of seating and a bbq suitable for large outdoor self-catering along with a hot tub and sauna. The property also benefits from a substantial glass palm room to the front.&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\nPlease note that The Castle is closed from August 2025 until June 2026 due to some ongoing repairs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&quot;,
                &quot;location_description&quot;: &quot;Nestled away in the Durham countryside and sitting...&quot;,
