            {
                &quot;id&quot;: 10,
                &quot;property_id&quot;: 591821,
                &quot;customer_property_id&quot;: &quot;OC&quot;,
                &quot;active&quot;: 1,
                &quot;property_name&quot;: &quot;Olive Cottage by Group Retreats&quot;,
                &quot;subcaption&quot;: &quot;&quot;,
                &quot;description&quot;: &quot;A very warm welcome to our cosy Cotswold cottage, Olive Cottage is nestled in the heart of Black Bourton, a picturesque Oxfordshire village. A short distance away from the beautiful Burford golf course and the famous market town of Bampton offering a wide range of shops, pubs, and restaurants.&quot;,
                &quot;accommodations_summary&quot;: &quot;&lt;p&gt;This is the ideal place to escape from the modern world and indulge with friends and family, for holidays, long weekends, or reunion get-togethers.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;The cottage offers a truly home from home holiday experience, a tranquil and peaceful location. The cottage is close to the Thames footpath, providing guests with traffic free scenic walks to enjoy during their stay.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;The sleeping quarters include 5 beautifully decorated bedrooms, with capacity for up to 11 guests, with plenty of room for large groups. The cottage is great for families, with a hot tub available to use throughout the year. All bed linen and towels are provided. There is also a separate entrance which gives you access to two bedrooms situated to the left of the main entrance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&quot;,
                &quot;location_description&quot;: &quot;\r\nBampton, England, United Kingdom\r\n\r\nLocated in t...&quot;,
