                &quot;id&quot;: 12,
                &quot;property_id&quot;: 613816,
                &quot;customer_property_id&quot;: &quot;HH&quot;,
                &quot;active&quot;: 1,
                &quot;property_name&quot;: &quot;Harkstead Hall By Group Retreats&quot;,
                &quot;subcaption&quot;: &quot;Impressive country house sleeping up to 20 guests with an outdoor hot tub&quot;,
                &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Group Retreats would like to welcome you to Harkstead Hall! This beautiful country home is set within private grounds and is wonderfully secluded. Harkstead Beach is just a walk from the property, and is an unspoilt oasis within the Holbrook Bay on the River Stour. There are plenty of spaces here to play or just be together, and smaller spaces to break out, read and unwind.&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWe do not allow parties and events when booking through Airbnb at this time.&quot;,
                &quot;accommodations_summary&quot;: &quot;There are a total of six bedrooms (of which four are en suite), plus a family bathroom. With superking zip and link beds in every room, plus four sofa beds, there are many different combinations of layout to suit you group. All bedding, linen and towels are provided.&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThere is a cosy lounge and separate drawing room, both with open fires, a perfect spot to enjoy a drink with family and friends. Within the fully stocked kitchen, you will find everything you could possibly need to prepare meals for everyone in your group. Alternatively, you could hire in a private chef to cook for you whilst you sit back and relax! The dining room can seat up to 18 guests, and we can provide an additional chairs should you need 2 more guests to be seated.&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\nOutside you are surrounded by stunning peaceful grounds in a private garden. You will find a secluded hot tub and sauna. Both are available all year around.Outside you will also find our above ground swimming pool, which is available from April - October. The decking area and sun loungers provides the perfect place to relax and create lasting memories. A barbecue is available for outside dining and entertaining, great for taking in the fantastic surroundings whilst enjoying fantastic food and company.&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHarkstead Hall is close to Alton Water which offers walking trails, cycling and water sports; there is plenty to do in the local area, whether you are looking for an active break, or to relax in comfort.&quot;,
                &quot;location_description&quot;: &quot;Nearby you will find local pubs, restaurants and c...&quot;,
