                &quot;id&quot;: 14,
                &quot;property_id&quot;: 628055,
                &quot;customer_property_id&quot;: &quot;GH &quot;,
                &quot;active&quot;: 1,
                &quot;property_name&quot;: &quot;Glentworth Manor by Group Retreats &quot;,
                &quot;subcaption&quot;: &quot;Sleeps 33, Stunning Country House, Swim Spa and Gardens&quot;,
                &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Welcome to Glentworth Hall, a truly striking Grade II listed Lincolnshire country house. Situated in a sought after location within 5 acres of glorious grounds., This period residence oozes elegance. Perfect to spend quality time with family or friends and escape from the modern world whether that be as a celebration, holiday or a relaxing break. Here you will find something for everyone.&quot;,
                &quot;accommodations_summary&quot;: &quot;On entering the property, you are greeted by a stunning gallery staircase. Inside you will find a well appointed kitchen with everything you need to prepare meals for everyone in the group, whether you choose to do it yourself or bring in a profession chef!&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThe games room is equipped with a pool table, air hockey and various board games, perfect for family and friends to all get together and have some fun.&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\nGlentworth Hall has 10 comfortable bedrooms sleeping up to 33 people. Bedrooms 1-7 all have ensuites with a further bathroom shared by rooms 8-10. Downstairs you will find a his and hers cloakroom.&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSurrounded by delightful countryside views, you will also have access to private formal gardens and paddock land, great to explore or enjoy a picnic. The outside swim/spa is perfect to unwind and take in the tranquil surroundings.&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\nAround a 20 minute drive away you will find Lincoln, a vibrant university city which offers a variety of facilities including an excellent choice of shops, restaurants, public houses and leisure activities.&quot;,
                &quot;location_description&quot;: &quot;In the Village of Glentworth, less than a 30 minut...&quot;,
