                &quot;property_name&quot;: &quot;Stables Cottage by Group Retreats&quot;,
                &quot;subcaption&quot;: &quot;&quot;,
                &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Welcome to Stables Cottage! Located near the popular town of Salisbury, this cosy cottage offers the ideal space to relax in between exploring the local attractions in the area.&quot;,
                &quot;accommodations_summary&quot;: &quot;Sleeping eight guests within three bedrooms, you can be sure that there is enough space for your entire group. If you&amp;#39;re not relaxing in the beautifully decorated lounge, why not try out our hot tub that is open all year round? In the garden you will also find outdoor seating, ensuring a peaceful area for you and your group to enjoy a barbecue or simply spend time together.&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\nEach bedroom provides a super king link bed, with one of the bedrooms also containing a bunk bed. We provide all bedding, linen, and towels to ensure that your group sleep comfortably.&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWithin the fully stocked kitchen, you will be sure to find everything you could need to prepare meals for you and your group. Alternatively, you could choose to hire in an external caterer to do the work for you whilst you sit back and relax. The dining table can seat eight guests, additionally to this we can provide a high chair so that your little one won&amp;#39;t miss out.&quot;,
