            {
                &quot;id&quot;: 21,
                &quot;property_id&quot;: 653651,
                &quot;customer_property_id&quot;: &quot;HBH&quot;,
                &quot;active&quot;: 1,
                &quot;property_name&quot;: &quot;Holbecks House by Group Retreats &quot;,
                &quot;subcaption&quot;: &quot;Stunning Grade II Listed 18th Century Country House in Hadleigh &ndash; Perfect for Family Gatherings &amp; Corporate Retreats&quot;,
                &quot;description&quot;: &quot;&lt;article data-scroll-anchor=\&quot;false\&quot; data-testid=\&quot;conversation-turn-2\&quot; data-turn=\&quot;assistant\&quot; data-turn-id=\&quot;request-WEB:929e2983-61b5-4afb-8e55-06cafbb30e90-0\&quot; dir=\&quot;auto\&quot; tabindex=\&quot;-1\&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-end=\&quot;493\&quot; data-start=\&quot;120\&quot;&gt;Discover the charm and elegance of this historic Grade II Listed 18th-century country house, set in the heart of Hadleigh&amp;#39;s beautiful countryside. Steeped in character and designed with comfort in mind, this impressive home offers the ideal setting for large family holidays, special occasions, and corporate getaways.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/article&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;article data-scroll-anchor=\&quot;true\&quot; data-testid=\&quot;conversation-turn-4\&quot; data-turn=\&quot;assistant\&quot; data-turn-id=\&quot;request-WEB:929e2983-61b5-4afb-8e55-06cafbb30e90-1\&quot; dir=\&quot;auto\&quot; tabindex=\&quot;-1\&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-end=\&quot;687\&quot; data-start=\&quot;442\&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/article&gt;\r\n&quot;,
                &quot;accommodations_summary&quot;: &quot;&lt;p data-end=\&quot;687\&quot; data-start=\&quot;442\&quot;&gt;With 12 spacious bedrooms, the house comfortably accommodates up to 34 guests. Flexible sleeping arrangements include superking link beds, doubles, singles, sofa beds, and folding Z beds, making it easy to tailor the space to your group&amp;rsquo;s needs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p data-end=\&quot;1108\&quot; data-start=\&quot;689\&quot;&gt;At the heart of the home is a fully equipped kitchen, stocked with everything needed for group catering &amp;mdash; from cookware to serving dishes &amp;mdash; whether you&amp;rsquo;re preparing meals yourselves or hiring in a private chef to take care of everything while you relax. Near to kitchen, the grand dining room features a large table that seats all 34 guests together, perfect for shared meals, celebrations, or business dinners.We can also supply two high chairs for any little ones.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p data-end=\&quot;1437\&quot; data-start=\&quot;1110\&quot;&gt;Inside, there&amp;rsquo;s no shortage of space to unwind. Multiple stylish lounges and drawing rooms offer peaceful spots for conversation or reading, while the dedicated games room brings the family together for games nights. &lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p data-end=\&quot;1728\&quot; data-start=\&quot;1439\&quot;&gt;Outside, the expansive gardens provide plenty of room to roam, play, or enjoy a peaceful coffee in the morning sun. For warmer months, the above-ground pool is open from 1st April to 1st October, while the hot tub is available all year round &amp;mdash; a luxurious touch for guests in every season.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p data-end=\&quot;1951\&quot; data-start=\&quot;1730\&quot;&gt;Whether you&amp;#39;re planning a multi-generational family holiday, a milestone celebration, or a corporate retreat, this exceptional home offers a unique blend of heritage, comfort, and convenience in a truly memorable setting.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p data-end=\&quot;2085\&quot; data-is-last-node=\&quot;\&quot; data-is-only-node=\&quot;\&quot; data-start=\&quot;1953\&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=\&quot;1969\&quot; data-start=\&quot;1953\&quot;&gt;Coming soon:&lt;/strong&gt; A charming on-site cottage will be available later next year, offering additional accommodation for up to 6 guests.&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\nPlease note that this property is under refurbishment, and so the photos are representative only.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&quot;,
                &quot;location_description&quot;: &quot;Hadleigh, Suffolk is a charming market town nestle...&quot;,
